  "description": "🚀 Complete toolkit for generating production-ready .NET 8 microservices with DDD, CQRS, Clean Architecture, Event-Driven Architecture, and comprehensive infrastructure. Generate enterprise-grade microservices with REST APIs, CQRS, MongoDB read models, RabbitMQ messaging, external service integration, Docker, Kubernetes, and complete testing suite.",
  "id": "MicroserviceKit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-06-09T06:43:40.607Z",
